@node Running tests
@section Running tests

The repository includes an ERT test suite in @samp{org-indent-pixel-test.el}. To run it locally:

@example
make test
@end example

To byte-compile with warnings treated as errors:

@example
make compile
@end example

@node Continuous integration
@section Continuous integration

A GitHub Actions workflow runs byte-compilation and the test suite on every push and pull request to the @samp{main} branch, against Emacs 29.4 and 30.1.

